#chip 18F4550, 20

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): Loop body: byte arithmetic, on 18F4550
'Expect: compiles, and the whole Repeat For construct runs exactly 100,000 clock cycles
'(checked by simulating the generated assembly instruction by instruction)

#option explicit
Dim Flag As Bit
Dim Cnt As Byte
Dim X As Byte
Dim Y As Byte
Dim W1 As Word
Dim W2 As Word
Repeat For 20 ms
    X = X + Y
    Y = Y + 3
End Repeat
Do
Loop
